<title>USA: Stone Street Bancorp sets special $0.11 div.</title>
<headline>Stone Street Bancorp sets special $0.11 div.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stone Street Bancorp Inc said it will pay a special, one-time dividend of $0.11 per share on January 2 to shareholders of record on December 20.</p>
<p>The special dividend will be in addition to the company's regular quarterly dividend of 11 cents a share, which it will pay on January 2 to shareholders of record on December 20.</p>
</text>
